OL,3,GNEWSATwo drivers test positive for
OL,4,Acocaine after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man and a woman have been arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of drug driving after a crash
OL,8,Finvolving two cars in Derbyshire.
OL,10,FPolice said the crash between an MG and
OL,11,FVauxhall occurred in Brimington Road
OL,12,FNorth, in Whittington near
OL,13,FChesterfield, at 21:45 GMT on Monday.
OL,15,FThe Derbyshire Roads Policing Unit said
OL,16,Fon Facebook that both drivers tested
OL,17,Fpositive for cocaine at the roadside.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
