OL,3,GNEWSATwo drivers test positive for
OL,4,Acocaine after crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe drivers were taken to hospital for
OL,7,Ftreatment to minor injuries, but no-one
OL,8,Fwas seriously hurt. A 55-year-old woman
OL,9,Fand 53-year-old man were detained
OL,10,Ffollowing the crash, the force
OL,11,Fconfirmed.
